# Kickdesk integration

This app is a **Kickdesk subscriber**. Read [`kickdesk.registration.json`](../../kickdesk.registration.json) first.

When changing dev ports, Docker compose host mappings, `package.json` scripts referenced by workflows, or Kickdesk integration:

1. Read Kickdesk spec files (readonly), if the sibling repo exists:
   - `../kickdesk/docs/MANIFEST.md`
   - `../kickdesk/examples/manifest.sample.json`
   - Or `$KICKDESK_ROOT` when set.
2. Update values in [`scripts/kickdesk-manifest.ts`](../../scripts/kickdesk-manifest.ts) — do not copy `manifest.sample.json` verbatim.
3. Run `pnpm kickdesk:publish-manifest` after port/script/workflow changes.
4. Run `pnpm db:migrate:status` after db up, migrate, or pulling new migrations.

Do not add `.kickdesk.json` in this repo; publish only to `~/.config/publicweb/`.

Guide: [`docs/guides/kickdesk-manifest.md`](../../docs/guides/kickdesk-manifest.md).
